<title>UGANDA: Uganda shilling weakens vs dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Uganda shilling weakens vs dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ugandan shilling weakened marginally against the dollar on a slight increase in demand, foreign exchange dealers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They posted the shilling at a mean rate of 1075 against the dollar compared to 1070 on Monday, while against the pound the shilling was posted at 1750 from 1730 on Monday.</p>
</text>
